# normals closed under affine maps (CoV) and sums (CF multiply, complete square).
normal_distribution normal_affine_closure
standard_normal normal_affine_closure
transformation_univariate normal_affine_closure
convolution_formula normal_affine_closure
characteristic_function normal_affine_closure
