cdf_properties portmanteau_theorem
# the implication lattice: Markov (L^p=>p), BC1 (p=>a.s. subseq), portmanteau (p=>d).
convergence_almost_sure convergence_implications
convergence_in_probability convergence_implications
convergence_in_lp convergence_implications
convergence_in_distribution convergence_implications
markov_inequality convergence_implications
borel_cantelli_first convergence_implications
